83Q90 683 161 688T234 694Q246 694 246 685T212 542Q204 508 195 472T180 418L176 399Q176 396 182 402Q231 442 283 442Q345 442 383 396T422 280Q422 169 343 79T173 -11Q123 -11 82 27T40 150V159Q40 180 48 217T97 414Q147 611 147 623T109 637Q104 637 101 637H96Q86 637 83 637T76 640T73 647ZM336 325V331Q336 405 275 405Q258 405 240 397T207 376T181 352T163 330L157 322L136 236Q114 150 114 114Q114 66 138 42Q154 26 178 26Q211 26 245 58Q270 81 285 114T318 219Q336 291 336 325Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E33-MJMATHI-63\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E33-MJMATHI-6D\" x=\"433\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E33-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"1589\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E33-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"2646\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\n<em>which implies that</em>\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"4.33ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 1864.4 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-34-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-34-Title\">\nc\\: | \\: b.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E34-MJMATHI-63\" d=\"M34 159Q34 268 120 355T306 442Q362 442 394 418T427 355Q427 326 408 306T360 285Q341 285 330 295T319 325T330 359T352 380T366 386H367Q367 388 361 392T340 400T306 404Q276 404 249 390Q228 381 206 359Q162 315 142 235T121 119Q121 73 147 50Q169 26 205 26H209Q321 26 394 111Q403 121 406 121Q410 121 419 112T429 98T420 83T391 55T346 25T282 0T202 -11Q127 -11 81 37T34 159Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E34-MJMAIN-7C\" d=\"M139 -249H137Q125 -249 119 -235V251L120 737Q130 750 139 750Q152 750 159 735V-235Q151 -249 141 -249H139Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E34-MJMATHI-62\" d=\"M73 647Q73 657 77 670T89 683Q90 683 161 688T234 694Q246 694 246 685T212 542Q204 508 195 472T180 418L176 399Q176 396 182 402Q231 442 283 442Q345 442 383 396T422 280Q422 169 343 79T173 -11Q123 -11 82 27T40 150V159Q40 180 48 217T97 414Q147 611 147 623T109 637Q104 637 101 637H96Q86 637 83 637T76 640T73 647ZM336 325V331Q336 405 275 405Q258 405 240 397T207 376T181 352T163 330L157 322L136 236Q114 150 114 114Q114 66 138 42Q154 26 178 26Q211 26 245 58Q270 81 285 114T318 219Q336 291 336 325Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E34-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E34-MJMATHI-63\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E34-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"655\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E34-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"1156\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E34-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"1585\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> </p>\n</blockquote>\n<!--\nLet's see some examples. Which of the following statements are true?\n\n<ol class=\"questionStatements\">\n<li>  If [math]28 \\: | \\: 45b[/math] then [math]28 \\: | \\: b[/math] </li>\n<li>  If [math]20 \\: | \\: 12b[/math] then [math]20 \\: | \\: b[/math] </li>\n<li>  If [math]5^3 \\: | \\: 32b[/math] then [math]5^3 \\: | \\: b[/math] </li>\n</ol>\n\n* Statement I is true. As [math]\\text{gcd}(28,45)=1[/math] and [math]28 \\: | \\: 45b,[/math] then we must have [math]28 \\: | \\: b.[/math]\n\n* Statement II is false. For example, let [math]b=5.[/math] Then, [math]b[/math] is not divisible by [math]20[/math] but [math]12b=60[/math] is still divisible by [math]20.[/math] \n\n* Statement III is true. As [math]\\text{gcd}(5^3,32)=1[/math] and [math]5^3 \\: | \\: 32b,[/math] then we must have [math]5^3 \\: | \\: b.[/math]\n\n-->\n           \n                </div>        \n                    \n            </div>",
